{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07519","headline":"和中丞出使恩命过终南别业 · 刘长卿","name":"和中丞出使恩命过终南别业","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不过林园久，多因宠遇偏。\n故山长寂寂，春草过年年。\n花待朝衣间，云迎驿骑连。\n松萝深旧合，樵木散闲田。\n拜阙贪摇佩，看琴懒更弦。\n君恩催早入，已梦[傅]岩边。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07519.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07519","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}